		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://chrisgaca.wordpress.com/?p=178</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Mary Yoder from our group and I went to a Village Harmony workshop with Patty Cuyler, who taught us this song. There is a bit of dance to it too (which is on the video link). The words are here: Ga gona ya tswanang le Jesu Ga gona ya tswanang naye &#160; &#160;&#160; Ka nyaka [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Mary Yoder from our group and I went to a Village Harmony workshop with Patty Cuyler, who taught us this song.  There is a bit of dance to it too (which is on the video link).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The words are here:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ga gona ya tswanang le Jesu</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ga gona ya tswanang naye &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ka nyaka nyaka gole gole</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ka dikuloga gole gole</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ka mo humana Jesu waka</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ga gona ya tswanang na ye</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<div class="jetpack-video-wrapper"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="605" height="341" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/24iRN1LRAR0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></div>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There are many versions of this on YouTube, including singers from South Africa, but I chose this link because it is the closest to what I learned, including the dance.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
