		<item>
		<title>Folk Songs from Bulgaria</title>
		<link>https://chrisgaca.wordpress.com/2012/10/01/molih-ta/</link>
					<comments>https://chrisgaca.wordpress.com/2012/10/01/molih-ta/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[chrisgaca]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 01 Oct 2012 19:24:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Bulgaria]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Molih Ta]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Songs by Country]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://chrisgaca.wordpress.com/?p=173</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[This song from Bulgaria was a shoe in for &#8220;most appropriate&#8221; song for a difficult theme.&#160; Our World Music Chorus has been asked to perform at a Utica conference called &#8220;Unspoken&#8221;.&#160; The conference is always about Human Rights issues but this year they chose gender equality issues as the main theme.&#160; Molih Ta is a [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This song from Bulgaria was a shoe in for &#8220;most appropriate&#8221; song for a difficult theme.&nbsp; Our World Music Chorus has been asked to perform at a Utica conference called &#8220;Unspoken&#8221;.&nbsp; The conference is always about Human Rights issues but this year they chose gender equality issues as the main theme.&nbsp; Molih Ta is a very moving song about a young girl&#8217;s request to her mother not to marry her off too early.&nbsp; Unfortunately, the girl&#8217;s request does not get granted and it serves as an example of some very old traditions relating to marriage that still are followed in the Balkans.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The link is to a YouTube version arranged by Philip Kotev.&nbsp; It&#8217;s a pretty uncomplicated song with a couple of lines of music repeating and repeating through the various verses, but I find when done like this group, it continuously holds your interest because of the changes in timbre between the different voices.</p>


<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<div class="jetpack-video-wrapper"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="605" height="341" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/IGZpU12vYbM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></div>
</div></figure>
]]></content:encoded>
					
